```java
class Product {
    private double price;

    public Product(double price) { setPrice(price); } // validate at construction

    public void setPrice(double price) {
        if (price < 0)
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("Price cannot be negative: " + price);
        this.price = price; // assigned only when valid
    }
}
new Product(-50); // throws immediately — bug caught at the source
```

